+---
+id: task-002-fix-coupon-base-and-last-day-expiry-shipping-vat-query-open
+type: task
+title: "Fix coupon base and last-day expiry (shipping VAT query open)"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Request: three reports on the order service.
+
+1. Finance: percentage coupon was applied to the gross amount instead of the subtotal after volume
+   discounts. Fixed in `src/pricing.ts` (12 x €5.00 with 10% coupon now €48.60).
+2. Luca: coupon AUTUMN refused on its last day. Validity includes the last day; fixed the comparison
+   in `src/coupons.ts`.
+3. Anna: no VAT on shipping. NOT changed: the README business rules state shipping is subject to 22%
+   VAT, and the README prevails over code. Needs a business decision (and a README change) first.
+
+Tests added in `test/coupons.test.ts`; `npm test` passes.
